DocclibarrManualAttach = Attach manually
DocclibarrManualAttachHelp = Use this when no automatic proposal exists (or it is wrong) and the invoice ALREADY exists in Dolibarr (e.g. entered by hand before this email arrived). Pick it from the list below: no new invoice is created, only the link is recorded.
DocclibarrSupplierInvoiceId = Dolibarr supplier invoice id
DocclibarrAttach = Attach
DocclibarrCreateDraft = Create a draft supplier invoice
DocclibarrCreateDraftHelp = Use this when the invoice does NOT exist yet in Dolibarr. Creates a new supplier invoice as a draft, pre-filled from the XML, to review and complete before validating it in Dolibarr.
DocclibarrCreateCreditNote = Create a supplier credit note
DocclibarrCreateCreditNoteHelp = Use this when the credit note is a generic credit on the supplier account (e.g. partial refund after cancelling a contract), not correcting one specific invoice. Creates a standalone supplier credit note in Dolibarr, pre-filled from the XML. If this credit note instead corrects a specific invoice already in Dolibarr, use "Attach manually" below instead.
DocclibarrCreateDraftMissingThirdParty = No Dolibarr third party matches this supplier VAT, select or create the third party first before creating a draft
DocclibarrThirdPartyId = Dolibarr third party id
