DocclibarrAlreadyProcessedValidated = This entry was already validated, no action possible
DocclibarrAlreadyProcessedRejected = This entry was already rejected, no action possible
DocclibarrStatusLegendTitle = What do the statuses mean?
DocclibarrMatchStatusQuarantineHelp = The email's origin could not be verified (DKIM/DMARC/domain). Nothing is extracted or trusted yet: review before trusting the content.
DocclibarrMatchStatusPendingHelp = Origin verified, but no usable XML (missing from the email, or not recognized as a valid Peppol invoice/credit note). Needs manual handling.
DocclibarrMatchStatusAutoMatchedHelp = The engine automatically found a matching existing Dolibarr supplier invoice. Just needs validating (green check available from the list).
DocclibarrMatchStatusUnmatchedHelp = Data extracted fine from the XML, but no automatic match: either it's a credit note (always manual), or no existing invoice matches. Attach manually or create a draft.
DocclibarrMatchStatusValidatedHelp = Processed: a human validated it (proposal, manual attach, or draft created). Nothing to do.
DocclibarrMatchStatusRejectedHelp = Processed: a human rejected it with a reason. Nothing to do.
DocclibarrMatchStatusSuspectHelp = Special case of "Unmatched": the customer VAT in the XML is present but doesn't match yours, a possible sign of impersonation. Check before attaching anything.
DocclibarrLinkedInvoice = Linked Dolibarr invoice
DocclibarrLinkedInvoiceNotFound = Dolibarr invoice not found (id %s), it may have been deleted since
DocclibarrResetBrokenLink = Reset this entry (linked invoice deleted)
DocclibarrResetRejected = Reset this entry (undo the rejection)
DocclibarrRecopyDocuments = Recopy PDF/XML onto this invoice
DocclibarrDraftAlreadyExists = A supplier invoice with this reference already exists: %s. No new draft proposed to avoid a duplicate, attach it instead via "Attach manually" above if not already done.
DocclibarrDraftAlreadyExistsError = A supplier invoice with this reference already exists, cannot create another one
